      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "substantive",
      "description": "The meaning of the operation moves to the activity type https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/activity-type/topographic-position-index, linked by activityType (gp:activityType). The definition no longer defines the operation; it was: \"The topographic position index (TPI) of Guisan et al. (1999): the difference between the elevation of each cell and the mean elevation of its neighbourhood.\"",
      "proposer": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/topographic-position-index"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/topographic-position-index/actions/operation-sources-2026-11-09",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "clarifying",
      "description": "The source defining the operation moves to the activity type: Guisan, A., Weiss, S.B., Weiss, A.D. (1999): GLM versus CCA spatial modeling of plant species distribution. Plant Ecology 143: 107-122.",
      "proposer": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/topographic-position-index"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/topographic-position-index/actions/representation-2026-11-09",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "substantive",
      "description": "The schema copied on each input and output that had one is replaced by the representation that realizes its data type in the data-formats register (decision D6): inputs/elevation -> elevation-model-geotiff (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentEncoding\": \"base64\", \"contentMediaType\": \"image/tiff\", \"description\": \"GeoTIFF\"}); outputs/result -> raster-single-band-geotiff (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentEncoding\": \"base64\", \"contentMediaType\": \"image/tiff\", \"description\": \"GeoTIFF\"}).",
      "proposer": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/topographic-position-index"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/topographic-position-index/actions/tools-2026-11-09",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "clarifying",
      "description": "Decision D4: tool keywords removed: ta_morphometry; 2 format keywords removed from inputs and outputs (inputs/elevation: GeoTIFF; outputs/result: GeoTIFF); sources removed (tools, testbed, the bbox schema now in the representation's format): SAGA 7.3.0 -- Topographic Position Index (TPI) <https://saga-gis.sourceforge.io/saga_tool_doc/7.3.0/ta_morphometry_18.html>; ZOO-Project Geonovum testbed -- SAGA.ta_morphometry.18: Topographic Position Index (TPI) <https://host1.tb.geonovum.geolabs.fr/ogc-api/processes/SAGA.ta_morphometry.18>; description rewritten without tool, host or testbed. Each removed tool or testbed reference remains findable at tier 4, in bblocks-process-profiles.",
      "proposer": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/topographic-position-index"
    },
    {
