      "changeClassification": "clarifying",
      "description": "Corrects what https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/topographic-position-index/actions/tools-2026-11-09 describes: the description sections removed then (sources, illustrations, data formats, multiplicity and the open question where present, and the Register position reference to the tier-4 process and its testbed URL) are restored. Tools and testbed stay in the prose; decision D4 applies to the model (keywords, source, properties), which carries none. Decision of 2026-11-09.",
      "proposer": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
